    60	
    61	The fight's moment-to-moment staging inside the planted geometry; each companion's experience of being Pathless; the night's sounds; the camp's small mercies; the walk back; the loft's lantern and its oil; the sensation language of the deep reading, held to sensation and never to explanation; both windows.
    62	
    63	## Where we leave pressure
    64	
    65	Day 100, the back room, minute twenty-one. A tenth fragment that does nothing in a fight; a woman who could not consent and has just been told she will be told; a covenant page in the loft; Lira slung for the season; Karis voiceless; a completion report about to go west with "Six went in" on it.

