editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:348:## 12. Canon conflicts found in the source (for owner ruling; drafting proceeds on the recommendation unless the owner rules otherwise)
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:353:- **C4 · "An index of forty-one kinds."** The universe bible and the canon ledger describe the kit's field ledger as carrying "an index of forty-one kinds." In the prose the ledger carries a *site designation in an index Seln does not know*, and forty-one is **Karis's count of kinds of carved line**, the same at the Ring and the Stair (Ch20; Book 8 Ch11 agrees). **Follow the prose.** Flag the bible wording for the canon pass.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:355:- **C6 · Oryn's lateness and the letter.** Ch12's "The route's eleven days north of here" and Ch15's "nine days late here and eleven at the next" do not reconcile (seams F5a, accepted as spoken). Ch18 projects Thornwater "eleven days late"; the closed prose then says **three weeks** at the fork (Ch23) and in the letter (Ch24), and Book 8 Ch1 quotes "Nobody died of three weeks." The architecture card and `series/THE_FRACTURED_PATH_SERIES.md` still say "eleven days." **The edition protects "three weeks."** Recommend writing Ch12's figure as a distance ("the far end of the route is eleven days north of here") and keeping the lateness arithmetic honest from day 104 (nine and eleven) to day 110 (Oxhollow seventeen) to the fork (three weeks).
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:356:- **C7 · Oryn's age.** "Late twenties" (Ch6, Cael's catalogue) against "Eleven years. I've never had my hands in something…" (Ch13). With Kindling LOCKED at fourteen, that makes her about twenty-five. **Recommend** never stating her age. "Late twenties" stays Cael's estimate; "eleven years" stands.
